# Workspace-level requirements (rare).
#
# Most requirements live on member crates — they're the load-bearing
# units. A workspace might carry one or two cross-cutting requirements
# (e.g., "all members must compile with MSRV X", "all members must
# expose a defmt feature"); use this file for those.
#
# Format mirrors the per-member requirements.toml: `[[source]]` +
# `[[requirement]]` arrays. See `library-api/requirements.toml.template`
# for the full shape.
